1. EMMAX (Efficient Mixed-Model Association eXpedited)
   Files: scripts/emmax-intel64, scripts/emmax-kin-intel64
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prebuilt static x86-64 binaries of EMMAX beta (07 March 2010), as distributed by the
author. Not built from source in this repository.

Copyright 2006-2010 Hyun Min Kang et al.

Terms: EMMAX ships no license file. The author has stated that "There is no license
attached with EMMAX" and that "you can consider it to be equivalent to widely used
public license (e.g. MIT license)". Debian packages EMMAX under the MIT License on
that basis. Source of these terms, read 2026-11-01:
  https://sources.debian.org/data/main/e/emmax/0~beta.20100307-6/debian/copyright
Upstream: http://genetics.cs.ucla.edu/emmax/ and https://csg.sph.umich.edu/kang/emmax/
(the original download page could not be reached on 2026-11-01).

The binaries are statically linked; their symbol and string tables carry Intel Math
Kernel Library (MKL) routines, which remain under Intel's terms.

Citation: Kang HM, Sul JH, Service SK, et al. (2010) Variance component model to
account for sample structure in genome-wide association studies. Nature Genetics
42:348-354.

