2. rdadapt (RDA outlier test)
   File: scripts/R/lib/rdadapt.R
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The function rdadapt() is adapted from Script_RDA.R in
  https://github.com/Capblancq/RDA-genome-scan
which carries no license file (checked 2026-11-01). The method is described in:

  Capblancq T, Luu K, Blum MGB, Bazin E (2018) Evaluation of redundancy analysis to
  identify signatures of local adaptation. Molecular Ecology Resources
  18(6):1223-1233. https://doi.org/10.1111/1755-0998.12906
